# 📊 Observability

## Logging
- Always log errors with enough context to debug but avoid sensitive data.
- Use structured logging where possible
- Include relevant identifiers (user ID, request ID, etc.)

## Monitoring
- If feature introduces performance impact, include metrics hooks.
- Track key user actions and business metrics

## Alerts
- Ensure critical flows (auth, payments, core data) have health checks or monitoring where possible.
- Set up appropriate alerting thresholds
